<Layout
	title="About"
	description="uncivilized media is a digital media network and production company sharing stories from around the world that center the narratives of peoples and places that have been underrepresented, silenced or erased."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	showDate={false}
>
	<p><em>Entertainment rooted in education.</em></p>

	<p>
		We are a digital media network and production company sharing stories from around the world
		that center the narratives of peoples and places that have been underrepresented, silenced or
		erased.
	</p>

	<p>
		Through engaging and entertaining multimedia content we aim to build a more equitable and
		representative media space that can challenge, disrupt and dismantle the media status quo that
		has excluded so many and rendered them voiceless.
	</p>

	<p>
		Our storytelling will be rooted in activism and community building that can inspire
		international solidarity, shared understanding and collective action against situations of
		injustice.
	</p>

	<p>
		As we tell our own stories, represent our identities, cultures and struggles, we aim to shake
		and reshape this world as we want it.
	</p>
</Layout>
